# LabFlow standing work order

Read and follow `LabFlow-work-order.md` at the repository root before every task. Its standing rules apply whether or not the prompt repeats them.

This Cursor rule keeps the pointer durable if Next.js regenerates `AGENTS.md`. `CLAUDE.md` also references `@LabFlow-work-order.md`.
